    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MR FARMBOY</strong> is a cute farming game with automation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build</strong> your <strong>dream farm</strong>, grow crops, raise animals, attract villagers, and hire workers to <strong>automate everything</strong>. <br> <br>\ud83c\udf31 <strong>Grow and Harvest Crops</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant, water, and harvest a variety of crops on your dream farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/5c40d8d0be4847ad5e3942df6eb2d67f.poster.avif?t=1753289957\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/5c40d8d0be4847ad5e3942df6eb2d67f.webm?t=1753289957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/5c40d8d0be4847ad5e3942df6eb2d67f.mp4?t=1753289957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc13 Raise Animals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build Chicken Coops and Barns to raise chickens, pigs, sheep, and cows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/1104ae7158839507fc8e90d297c14c77.poster.avif?t=1753289957\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/1104ae7158839507fc8e90d297c14c77.webm?t=1753289957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/1104ae7158839507fc8e90d297c14c77.mp4?t=1753289957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f Build Your Farm</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct Markets, bridges, animal shelters, and more to grow your farming empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/24b219884b41fc917646ebcb6c53052c.poster.avif?t=1753289957\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/24b219884b41fc917646ebcb6c53052c.webm?t=1753289957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/24b219884b41fc917646ebcb6c53052c.mp4?t=1753289957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Automate Your Farm</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire Farmers, Gatherers, and Carriers to fully automate production and logistics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/6b9a39ab4c70245d8ada339224efa453.poster.avif?t=1753289957\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/6b9a39ab4c70245d8ada339224efa453.webm?t=1753289957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/6b9a39ab4c70245d8ada339224efa453.mp4?t=1753289957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 Sell to Villagers </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attract villagers to your farm and sell your goods to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddd8 Relax and Strategize</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a cozy atmosphere while optimizing your farm\u2019s automation. <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/b10a6cca83d559e7383d39bfe5eb2bd1.poster.avif?t=1753289957\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/b10a6cca83d559e7383d39bfe5eb2bd1.webm?t=1753289957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/b10a6cca83d559e7383d39bfe5eb2bd1.mp4?t=1753289957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
